e_given": false, "device_or_browser_given": false, "identity_details_given": false, "sensitive_data_present": false, "likely_apple_user": false}}], "written": {"batch0089_0": ["Hello there, I hope your week is going well.", "I've contacted support about an account problem before and I'm hopeful we can get it sorted.", "On my iPad I'm locked out because tapping Sign In with my password shows \"Invalid password\" with no workaround, so others face this too.", "Separately, the refund for the $58.40 I was charged through another payment method never arrived, so I'd love to see that money back.", "Also, it would be a nice touch if your delivery service offered family or team sharing someday."], "batch0089_1": ["Honestly, your useless staff delivered the wrong item, which is beyond unacceptable and frankly insulting to anyone who actually pays you.", "Anyway, since switching to a new phone I can't log in after already trying a password reset, with no workaround and a deadline looming.", "Thanks to switching to a new phone I'm furious, so refund my money or give me store credit, you pathetic excuse for a shop."]}, "cost_usd": 0.027193099999999998, "seconds": 205.9, "thinking_tokens": 53350}